 "lines": [
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 0,
   "start": 1.2,
   "dur": 2.39,
   "speech": "这一集换一个问法。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 1,
   "start": 3.77,
   "dur": 3.54,
   "speech": "不问明天涨多少，问它会落在哪。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 2,
   "start": 7.49,
   "dur": 3.97,
   "speech": "点预测给一个数，分布预测给一条线。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 3,
   "start": 11.65,
   "dur": 5.1,
   "speech": "一条线上有很多分位点：一成、五成、九成。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 4,
   "start": 16.93,
   "dur": 3.88,
   "speech": "每个分位点回答：低于它的概率有多大。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 5,
   "start": 20.99,
   "dur": 4.45,
   "speech": "听起来只是把输出从一个数变成几个数。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 6,
   "start": 25.62,
   "dur": 4.31,
   "speech": "但麻烦马上出现：这几条线会互相穿过。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 7,
   "start": 30.11,
   "dur": 4.53,
   "speech": "一条说要跌，另一条说要涨，顺序却反了。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 8,
   "start": 34.82,
   "dur": 4.19,
   "speech": "这一集就量一件事：这种交叉有多严重。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 9,
   "start": 39.19,
   "dur": 3.73,
   "speech": "以及，把它修好要付多少代价。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 10,
   "start": 43.1,
   "dur": 3.97,
   "speech": "先说清楚为什么值得单独讲一集。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 11,
   "start": 47.25,
   "dur": 3.54,
   "speech": "因为分位数之间有一个天然的次序。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 12,
   "start": 50.98,
   "dur": 4.48,
   "speech": "九成线必须在一成线上面，这是定义的一部分。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 13,
   "start": 55.63,
   "dur": 4.74,
   "speech": "可如果九条线各自独立训练，它们并不知道彼此。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 14,
   "start": 60.56,
   "dur": 4.38,
   "speech": "于是区间可能翻过来：上线掉到下线下面。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 15,
   "start": 65.12,
   "dur": 2.68,
   "speech": "书里叫分位线交叉。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 16,
   "start": 67.98,
   "dur": 4.86,
   "speech": "它不是为了好看才要修，交叉会让区间失去意义。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 17,
   "start": 73.02,
   "dur": 3.95,
   "speech": "一个会说谎的区间，比没有区间更糟。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 18,
   "start": 77.15,
   "dur": 4.02,
   "speech": "第二件事是代价：修它要不要牺牲精度。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 19,
   "start": 81.35,
   "dur": 4.14,
   "speech": "如果代价接近零，那就没有理由不修。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 20,
   "start": 85.67,
   "dur": 4.19,
   "speech": "先看四个数，后面每一场都会回到它们。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 21,
   "start": 90.04,
   "dur": 3.4,
   "speech": "第一，交叉率百分之三点三六。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 22,
   "start": 93.62,
   "dur": 3.69,
   "speech": "在七百二十八个测试样本上量出来。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 23,
   "start": 97.49,
   "dur": 3.3,
   "speech": "第二，排序之后交叉率归零。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 24,
   "start": 100.97,
   "dur": 4.38,
   "speech": "第三，pinball 损失只变了百分之零点二六。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 25,
   "start": 105.53,
   "dur": 4.05,
   "speech": "零点七二六七，变成零点七二四九。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 26,
   "start": 109.76,
   "dur": 4.45,
   "speech": "第四，整个证据程序跑完只要二点一八秒。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 27,
   "start": 114.39,
   "dur": 2.87,
   "speech": "十八项检查全部通过。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 28,
   "start": 117.44,
   "dur": 3.01,
   "speech": "这四个数合起来说一件事。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 29,
   "start": 120.63,
   "dur": 3.76,
   "speech": "顺序可以免费加上，精度几乎不掉。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 30,
   "start": 124.57,
   "dur": 2.25,
   "speech": "接下来分八场。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 31,
   "start": 127,
   "dur": 3.28,
   "speech": "第一场说问题：为什么一个数不够。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 32,
   "start": 130.46,
   "dur": 4.74,
   "speech": "第二场定义三件东西：损失、次序、分布。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 33,
   "start": 135.38,
   "dur": 3.47,
   "speech": "第三场把数据与口径钉死。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 34,
   "start": 139.03,
   "dur": 3.04,
   "speech": "第四场量交叉率与代价。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 35,
   "start": 142.25,
   "dur": 4.26,
   "speech": "第五场写实现：三个模块、二百五十九行。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 36,
   "start": 146.69,
   "dur": 3.64,
   "speech": "第六场验证：十八项检查逐条过。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 37,
   "start": 150.51,
   "dur": 4.09,
   "speech": "第七场讲边界：结论在什么条件下成立。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 38,
   "start": 154.78,
   "dur": 3.23,
   "speech": "第八场收束，指向下一集。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 39,
   "start": 158.19,
   "dur": 3.66,
   "speech": "每一页的数字都能用一条命令复现。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 0,
   "start": 165.25,
   "dur": 2.58,
   "speech": "先从这个困境说起。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 1,
   "start": 168.01,
   "dur": 3.45,
   "speech": "你训练一个模型预测明天收益。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 2,
   "start": 171.64,
   "dur": 3.06,
   "speech": "它给你一个数，比如零点三。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 3,
   "start": 174.88,
   "dur": 3.28,
   "speech": "这个数没有告诉你它有多确定。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 4,
   "start": 178.34,
   "dur": 3.16,
   "speech": "也没有告诉你最坏会到哪。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 5,
   "start": 181.68,
   "dur": 3.59,
   "speech": "风控要的不是一个数，是一个区间。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 6,
   "start": 185.45,
   "dur": 4.05,
   "speech": "区间要能说：九成情况下不会超出这里。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 7,
   "start": 189.67,
   "dur": 3.33,
   "speech": "这就是分位数回归要回答的事。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 8,
   "start": 193.18,
   "dur": 3.28,
   "speech": "把输出从一个数扩成一条线。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 9,
   "start": 196.64,
   "dur": 3.04,
   "speech": "线由若干个分位点钉出来。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 10,
   "start": 199.85,
   "dur": 3.16,
   "speech": "问题出在怎么训练这条线。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 11,
   "start": 203.19,
   "dur": 4.33,
   "speech": "最直接的做法：每个分位点单独训一个模型。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 12,
   "start": 207.71,
   "dur": 3.37,
   "speech": "九条线就是九个独立的回归。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 13,
   "start": 211.26,
   "dur": 4,
   "speech": "每个只看自己的损失，不知道别的线在哪。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 14,
   "start": 215.44,
   "dur": 4.09,
   "speech": "样本一少、特征一多，估计误差就大。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 15,
   "start": 219.71,
   "dur": 4.38,
   "speech": "于是某一天，一成线的预测比九成线还高。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 16,
   "start": 224.27,
   "dur": 4.21,
   "speech": "这不是代码错了，是九个模型各说各话。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 17,
   "start": 228.67,
   "dur": 3.76,
   "speech": "书里量到的交叉率在百分之三到五。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 18,
   "start": 232.61,
   "dur": 4.07,
   "speech": "本集在自己的数据上是百分之三点三六。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 19,
   "start": 236.86,
   "dur": 3.83,
   "speech": "量级对上了，说明这不是偶发现象。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 20,
   "start": 240.87,
   "dur": 4.02,
   "speech": "为什么交叉是个真问题，而不只是不好看。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 21,
   "start": 245.07,
   "dur": 3.16,
   "speech": "区间是拿两条线夹出来的。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 22,
   "start": 248.41,
   "dur": 4.33,
   "speech": "如果上线掉到下线下面，宽度变成负数。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 23,
   "start": 252.92,
   "dur": 3.52,
   "speech": "你没法解释一个宽度为负的区间。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 24,
   "start": 256.62,
   "dur": 3.4,
   "speech": "下游的覆盖率统计也会跟着崩。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 25,
   "start": 260.2,
   "dur": 4,
   "speech": "更麻烦的是，它只在少数样本上发生。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 26,
   "start": 264.37,
   "dur": 4.17,
   "speech": "少数样本会把整体指标悄悄拖偏。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 27,
   "start": 268.72,
   "dur": 4.43,
   "speech": "所以要么训练时加约束，要么输出后修。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 28,
   "start": 273.33,
   "dur": 3.57,
   "speech": "本集走第二条：输出之后排个序。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 29,
   "start": 277.08,
   "dur": 3.49,
   "speech": "先量清楚代价，再决定值不值。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 30,
   "start": 280.75,
   "dur": 2.61,
   "speech": "具体要回答三个问题。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 31,
   "start": 283.54,
   "dur": 3.47,
   "speech": "第一，独立训练到底交叉多少。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 32,
   "start": 287.19,
   "dur": 3.71,
   "speech": "第二，排序修好之后损失变多少。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 33,
   "start": 291.08,
   "dur": 4.24,
   "speech": "第三，高斯头的覆盖率配不配得上名义值。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 34,
   "start": 295.49,
   "dur": 3.23,
   "speech": "三个问题各对应一组检查。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 35,
   "start": 298.9,
   "dur": 4.53,
   "speech": "验收线先写下来：交叉率落在百分之一到十。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 36,
   "start": 303.61,
   "dur": 4.72,
   "speech": "这是书里的量级，太干净反而说明设定不对。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 37,
   "start": 308.51,
   "dur": 2.8,
   "speech": "排序后交叉必须归零。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 38,
   "start": 311.49,
   "dur": 3.21,
   "speech": "损失变化必须小于百分之二。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 39,
   "start": 314.87,
   "dur": 3.83,
   "speech": "覆盖率与名义九十五差多少，照实说。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 0,
   "start": 322.1,
   "dur": 2.05,
   "speech": "先定义损失。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 1,
   "start": 324.33,
   "dur": 3.13,
   "speech": "pinball 损失也叫分位数损失。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 2,
   "start": 327.65,
   "dur": 4.41,
   "speech": "给定分位 tau 和预测 q，还有真实值 y。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 3,
   "start": 332.23,
   "dur": 3.73,
   "speech": "如果 y 在 q 上面，罚 tau 乘距离。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 4,
   "start": 336.15,
   "dur": 4.12,
   "speech": "如果 y 在 q 下面，罚一减 tau 乘距离。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 5,
   "start": 340.45,
   "dur": 3.66,
   "speech": "tau 等于零点九时，低估罚九成。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 6,
   "start": 344.29,
   "dur": 3.81,
   "speech": "高估只罚一成，它宁可往高里猜。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 7,
   "start": 348.27,
   "dur": 3.09,
   "speech": "tau 等于零点一时反过来。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 8,
   "start": 351.54,
   "dur": 5.44,
   "speech": "四个黄金值：零点九、零点一、零点一、零点九。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 9,
   "start": 357.16,
   "dur": 3.73,
   "speech": "这个不对称，就是分位数的全部秘密。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 10,
   "start": 361.07,
   "dur": 3.45,
   "speech": "单点损失要聚合成一个标量。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 11,
   "start": 364.7,
   "dur": 3.52,
   "speech": "对所有样本、所有分位取平均。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 12,
   "start": 368.4,
   "dur": 4.12,
   "speech": "分母是分位个数乘样本数，不是样本数。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 13,
   "start": 372.69,
   "dur": 4.5,
   "speech": "我第一次写就漏了这个除法，数值大了九倍。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 14,
   "start": 377.38,
   "dur": 3.88,
   "speech": "检查立刻抓到，因为手算的锚点对不上。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 15,
   "start": 381.43,
   "dur": 3.06,
   "speech": "另一件工具是经验分位。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 16,
   "start": 384.68,
   "dur": 4.02,
   "speech": "把样本排序，取第 ceil(tau 乘 n) 个。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 17,
   "start": 388.88,
   "dur": 3.16,
   "speech": "这就是最朴素的分位数定义。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 18,
   "start": 392.22,
   "dur": 3.61,
   "speech": "它不做插值，和 numpy 的 lower 一致。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 19,
   "start": 396.01,
   "dur": 3.73,
   "speech": "后面用它构造对照，不参与训练。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 20,
   "start": 399.92,
   "dur": 2.22,
   "speech": "现在定义交叉。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 21,
   "start": 402.33,
   "dur": 3.78,
   "speech": "对每一个样本，九条线给出九个值。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 22,
   "start": 406.29,
   "dur": 4,
   "speech": "任取两条线，tau 小的那条应该更低。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 23,
   "start": 410.47,
   "dur": 3.78,
   "speech": "如果它反而更高，就记一个逆序对。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 24,
   "start": 414.43,
   "dur": 4.41,
   "speech": "交叉率等于逆序对数除以对子数乘样本数。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 25,
   "start": 419.01,
   "dur": 3.47,
   "speech": "对子数是九选二，三十六。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 26,
   "start": 422.66,
   "dur": 4.65,
   "speech": "样本七百二十八，总共有两万六千二百零八对。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 27,
   "start": 427.49,
   "dur": 3.85,
   "speech": "少于两条线时直接报错，不返回零。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 28,
   "start": 431.52,
   "dur": 3.45,
   "speech": "这个口径比书里更严格一点。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 29,
   "start": 435.15,
   "dur": 2.94,
   "speech": "好处是可以逐对审计。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 30,
   "start": 438.27,
   "dur": 4.09,
   "speech": "修法只有一句：每个样本的九个值排个序。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 31,
   "start": 442.55,
   "dur": 4.36,
   "speech": "排序不改变这九个数的集合，只改变顺序。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 32,
   "start": 447.08,
   "dur": 4.55,
   "speech": "所以它叫零成本：没有新参数，没有新训练。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 33,
   "start": 451.81,
   "dur": 4.14,
   "speech": "它也不改变任何一条线在单点上的能力。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 34,
   "start": 456.14,
   "dur": 4.45,
   "speech": "代价只可能来自损失函数如何看待组合。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 35,
   "start": 460.77,
   "dur": 2.49,
   "speech": "下一件事是分布头。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 36,
   "start": 463.44,
   "dur": 4.45,
   "speech": "不再给分位，直接给高斯：均值与标准差。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 37,
   "start": 468.07,
   "dur": 4.57,
   "speech": "sigma 由原始参数经 softplus 保证为正。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 38,
   "start": 472.82,
   "dur": 4.14,
   "speech": "训练用负对数似然，也就是 NLL。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 39,
   "start": 477.15,
   "dur": 3.49,
   "speech": "它同时惩罚均值偏和方差错。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "metrics",
   "index": 0,
   "start": 484.04,
   "dur": 3.49,
   "speech": "数据是 000001 的日收益。"
  },
