   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 5,
   "start": 659.98,
   "dur": 5.08,
   "speech": "证据程序二百八十二行，把读数写进 JSON。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 6,
   "start": 665.24,
   "dur": 3.81,
   "speech": "三个模块互不引用，可以单独拷走。"
