   "dur": 2.58,
   "speech": "分布头有三个部件。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 31,
   "start": 760.64,
   "dur": 4.43,
   "speech": "NLL：负对数似然，sigma 必须为正。"
  },
  {
